    "description": "<p>You spit up a puddle of mud from your stomach after molding chakra which transforms into a Dragon head that then opens its mouth and fires compressed balls of mud that are meant to cause concussive damage on impact. Make two ranged ninjutsu attacks targeting different creatures. On a hit the target takes 4d6 earth damage and must make a constitution saving throw. On a failed save they are Staggered.</p>\n<p>At Higher Ranks: For each rank you cast this jutsu above C-Rank, increase the cost of this jutsu by 3 and damage by 1d6</p>",
